[en.EVENT_NUKES_1]
Overcharged Artifact Attack at [FROM.FROM.GetName]

[en.EVENT_NUKES_1_desc]
We were attacked by a magictron device — <=Artifact-Triggered Original Magictron Implosion and Collision Bomb=> ! This is a large-scale destructive weapon based on the release of magictron energy induced by the detonation of overcharged.

“When that thing fell from the sky, everything became complicated, as if space and time no longer existed, things disappeared and reappeared, the sun set and rose again. The stone changed rapidly, while the dust remained still before my eyes. After that, there was silence.”

[en.EVENT_NUKES_1_o0]
Alas...

[zh.EVENT_NUKES_1]
过充能法器袭击[FROM.FROM.GetName]

[zh.EVENT_NUKES_1_desc]
我们遭到了魔法子装置——「原发性魔法子法器诱导内爆碰撞炸弹」的袭击！这是一种基于引爆过充能法器诱导魔法子能量释放的大规模杀伤性武器。

“那东西落下的时候，一切都变得复杂起来，像空间和时间不复存在了般，东西消失又出现，太阳落下又升起。石头飞快的变化，灰尘则在眼前静止。此后，便是寂静。”

[zh.EVENT_NUKES_1_o0]
唉...
